                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The most annoying game I've played recently. Not to mention the slow af walking which wasted my time for no reason. Difficult in a dumb way, for the sake of being difficult.\n\nI like challenging games with clever puzzles that sometimes I can't find a solution to, which is okay. But this one, omg, it rage-baited me so hard. I wish I'd refunded it when I had the chance.\n\nBasically, this is a case of \"we have Inside/Limbo at home.\" A cheap copycat of said games.",
